{"labs": [{"id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le06ob03re2img08.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: </br>Hi, V! So, how's your new crush, Marco? I was surprised to hear he's Australian! I think the Australian accent is kind of hard to understand. If he's handsome, then I guess it's OK, though. LOL. I'm waiting to hear an update! Write back soon!</p>", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le06ob03re2img08.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\"></span>Love,\nSal</p>", "id": 2, "time": "19000", "image": "engenn5le06ob03re2img08.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:</br>\nSally! Great to hear from you! Where are you now? Things are great at work. Marco and I are still talking often. He is a big flirt! He has the most beautiful big, brown eyes with long lashes ... it's hard to look away! He traveled to Europe to study culinary arts. He's really intelligent and witty. We laugh so much! I was shocked to hear he doesn't have a girlfriend!</p>", "id": 3, "time": "22000", "image": "engenn5le06ob03re2img07.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\"></span>Talk soon,\nV</p>", "id": 4, "time": "49750", "image": "engenn5le06ob03re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le06ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le06ob03re2img08.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [], "audiosrc": "engenn5le06ob03re6aud01", "coverimg": ""}, "type": "picture"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 4, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [], "audiosrc": "engenn5le06ob03re6aud02", "coverimg": ""}, "type": "picture"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "_data": [