learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Order of Adjectives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " When you describe a person's appearance using more than one adjective, you must follow a special order.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "He has beautiful, big brown eyes. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Begin your description with:<br><br>  He has ...<br> She has ...<br>They have ... <br><br> Look at the chart:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Opinion\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Size\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Colour\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Noun\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">beautiful</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">big</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">brown</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">eyes</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">lovely</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">long</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">blonde</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">hair</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "She has lovely, long blonde hair.<br/> <br/> <br/>", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Reacting to a Story", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When someone tells you a story, it is important to react to show that you are listening and that you are interested.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use these phrases to comment or react to a story:<br><br>  I was surprised to hear ... <br>I was shocked to hear ... <br>Oh, really?<br> Wow! <br>That's interesting!<br> Tell me more!", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Anna</span>: The new employee is Australian.<br><span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: Oh, really? Tell me more!", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "crush", "type": "name"}, {"content": "feelings of attraction for someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: So, how's your new crush?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le06ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about people.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "flirt ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who likes to show their attraction to someone else ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He is a big flirt!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le06ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "handsome", "type": "name"}, {"content": "describes a good-looking man ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He is handsome.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le06ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "intelligent ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " smart ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He is very intelligent and funny.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le06ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "lashes", "type": "name"}, {"content": " short for eyelashes (the hair growing on the edge of the eyelid) ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He has long lashes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le06ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "update ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the latest information ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm waiting to hear an update!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le06ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "witty ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "smart and funny ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He is very witty.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le06ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Draw a simple picture of someone you know.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Don't show it to your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Describe the person using many adjectives.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask your partner to draw the person following your description.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Compare your drawing with your partner's. How are they the same? How are they different?", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I draw a simple picture of someone.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe my picture to my partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe people using correct sentences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I compare my picture with my partner's.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}